# Canonical production origin. Every canonical URL, Open Graph tag, sitemap
# entry and JSON-LD @id is built from this value.
#
# Committed deliberately (only `.env*.local` is gitignored) so the correct
# domain ships with the repo and Vercel builds pick it up without depending on
# a dashboard setting. A Vercel environment variable of the same name still
# takes precedence if you ever move to a custom domain.
#
# No trailing slash — content/site.ts strips one defensively, but keep it clean.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://piyushprajapati.vercel.app
